        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "4cd8ca3e-2f24-5f27-9658-6ad836febeee",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 349,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:1",
          "start": 315
        },
        "quote": "(a) Name and address of applicant.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "9c830fc7-7cee-5a44-be77-e07b78c56d1d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 392,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:2",
          "start": 350
        },
        "quote": "(b) Volume of wastewater to be discharged.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "79d22b58-0153-52ee-a892-7458ce889a4a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 612,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:3",
          "start": 393
        },
        "quote": "(c) Constituents and characteristics of strength of the wastewater, including but not limited to those contained in TMC 13.20.280 and 13.20.300 concerning unlawful waste discharge and limitations on wastewater strength.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "62a775dd-7cf5-51e8-873f-039f658113e9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 648,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:4",
          "start": 613
        },
        "quote": "(d) Time and duration of discharge.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "a6465820-3249-5a11-af71-6b6bd8a00a33",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 759,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:5",
          "start": 649
        },
        "quote": "(e) Average and 30-minute peak wastewater flow rates, including daily, monthly and seasonal variations if any.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "3a6d7da4-fa0a-5860-88c6-c0ca78d61136",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 900,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:6",
          "start": 760
        },
        "quote": "(f) A plat showing location and size of building sewers, sampling points, pretreatment facilities, public sewer and other pertinent details.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "2d36cfaa-9853-5a96-aafd-24453bdf3950",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1125,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:7",
          "start": 901
        },
        "quote": "(g) General description of activities, facilities and plant processes on the premises, including either the principal product and the quantity per day produced or the principal raw material and the quantity per day consumed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "676e9e1d-9dda-555b-915c-617dc0a46fd4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1214,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:8",
          "start": 1126
        },
        "quote": "(h) The standard industrial classification rating describing the applicant’s facilities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "4c3d623d-f0c9-5070-ac9a-a9fd82fcaf1c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1257,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:9",
          "start": 1215
        },
        "quote": "(i) Number of employees and hours of work.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "4c0e1f2e-2765-5699-bd73-632046df595a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1677,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:10",
          "start": 1258
        },
        "quote": "(j) Where known, the nature and concentration of any pollutants in the discharge which are limited by any City, State or Federal pretreatment standards, and a statement regarding whether or not the pretreatment standards are being met on a consistent basis, and if not, whether additional operation and maintenance (O&M) and/or additional pretreatment is required for the user to meet applicable pretreatment standards.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "9a47b9ab-6b5b-5899-a8b3-9df018f21c26",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2045,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:11",
          "start": 1678
        },
        "quote": "(k) If additional pretreatment and/or O&M will be required to meet the pretreatment standards, the shortest schedule by which the user will provide such additional pretreatment; the completion date in this schedule shall not be later than the compliance date established for the applicable pretreatment standard. The following conditions shall apply to this schedule:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "d2db7c94-86c5-5af6-8274-91620976daa8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2488,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:12",
          "start": 2046
        },
        "quote": "(1) The schedule shall contain increments of progress in the form of dates for the commencement and completion of major events leading to the construction and operation of additional pretreatment required for the user to meet the applicable pretreatment standards (e.g., hiring an engineer, completing preliminary plans, completing final plans, executing contract for major components, commencing construction, completing construction, etc.).",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "97eb0ae2-a757-5d2b-ac02-b686078c56ca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2580,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:13",
          "start": 2489
        },
        "quote": "(2) No increment referred to in subsection (k)(1) of this section shall exceed nine months.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "a8c6a5d3-29ef-5801-91a1-93c8daef0181",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3264,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:14",
          "start": 2581
        },
        "quote": "(3) The user shall submit a progress report to the Water Pollution Control Division no later than 14 days following each date in a compliance schedule, and on the final date for compliance, the user shall submit a progress report to the Utilities Director including, as a minimum, whether or not the user complied with the increment of progress to be met on such date and, if not, the date on which the user expects to comply with the increment of progress, the reason(s) for the delay and the steps being taken by the user to return the construction to the schedule established. In no event shall more than nine months elapse between such progress reports to the Utilities Director.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 13.20.430 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "543c3adf-62a7-5057-97a8-aea85ab3f629",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3424,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:15",
          "start": 3265
        },
        "quote": "(l) A certification statement by an authorized representative of the industrial user in accordance with 40 CFR Section 403.12(l) . (Ord. 20089 § 64, 10-17-17.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.430:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
